Z||000000||Double07||09-28-2000||08:29 PM||||On my 86 Fiero, 6cyl, 4sp, my oil pressure was only 18 to 20. I put in a high volume oil pump and now i only get 20 to 25. Sometimes it gets below 20. Any ideas???||||reg||1
Z||000001||Carrolles||09-28-2000||08:34 PM||||Have you checked to see if your gauge is accurate?  Those aren't bad numbers for a high mileage engine.  My newly rebuilt 2.8 with a stock oil pump runs 80 when cold and 60 during normal operating temps.||||reg||1
